{#- WEBSITE › PAGES (mockup board "Site words by page", with Chase's notes:
   labels first; every language control with the words; everything a
   visitor reads translatable). LAID OUT AS THE STAFF SITE CREATOR'S PAGES
   TAB (Chase, 2026-10-20: "have an independent Pages tab with dropdown
   menus to select the page, have the page follow where you click"): the
   pages as a list first — every page there is, the ones a visitor only
   meets after pressing a link in an email too — then one page's lines,
   with "← All Pages" and a menu of the pages at the top. The preview
   beside it shows that page, and a link pressed in the preview opens
   that page's lines.

   ONE LANGUAGE AT A TIME, "Writing X beside Y" (website/writing.njk,
   above the tabs it serves): the line being written, with the same line
   in another language above it. Not a column per language, which stops
   working somewhere around four; the site's languages are meant to grow
   to thirty.

   EACH LINE IS NAMED FOR WHAT IT IS ("Small Line Above the Headline"),
   with its key kept small beside it. A heading stored as two strings for
   its bold half is ONE line here, edited as it reads, with B to mark where
   the bold begins. How a page shows in a search and when shared is on
   Advanced.

   WHAT YOU SEE IS WHAT YOU DOWNLOAD. The file for a translator holds the
   lines on screen — a page, a search, Needs Work, All — and More says how
   many. -#}

<div class="c-tools-row c-find-row">
  <input type="search" id="cFind" autocomplete="off"
         placeholder="Find a word" aria-label="Find a word"
         data-i18n-attr="placeholder:con.find,aria-label:con.find">
  <button type="button" class="ghost-btn" id="cLangs" disabled data-i18n="con.languages">Languages</button>
  <div class="c-more">
    <button type="button" class="ghost-btn" id="cMoreBtn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cMore">
      <span data-i18n="con.more">More</span><span class="console-caret" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </button>
    <div class="c-more-menu" id="cMore">
      <button type="button" id="cDown"></button>
      <button type="button" id="cUp" data-i18n="tl.upload">Upload Translation</button>
      {#- "Nothing has changed" is a claim about the copy this page loaded; the
         remedy for doubting it is to read again. -#}
      <button type="button" id="cReload" data-i18n="con.reload">Reload from GitHub</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <input type="file" id="cFile" accept=".csv,text/csv" hidden
         aria-label="Upload translation" data-i18n-attr="aria-label:tl.upload">
</div>

{#- Shown instead of the editor when GITHUB_TOKEN is absent. -#}
<p class="rolegate" id="cNotConfigured" hidden></p>

<div class="adm-content" id="cRoot" hidden>
  {#- "← All Pages" and the menu of pages, over one page's lines; drawn by
      admin-content.js -#}
  <div class="ws-crumb c-crumb" id="cCrumb" hidden></div>
  <span class="c-count" id="cCount" role="status"></span>
  <div class="c-rows" id="cRows"></div>
</div>

{#- A returned translation, line by line, in place of the editor until it is
   approved or put away. Lines the checks flag start unticked. -#}
<div class="c-review" id="tlReview" hidden>
  <div class="tl-bar">
    <span class="tl-count" id="tlReviewCount" role="status"></span>
    <button type="button" class="ghost-btn" id="tlCancel" data-i18n="common.cancel">Cancel</button>
    <button type="button" class="solid-btn" id="tlApprove"></button>
  </div>
  <div class="tl-items" id="tlItems"></div>
</div>

{#- EVERY LANGUAGE, IN ONE PLACE (mockup board "Every language, in one
   place"): one row per language — how much is translated, on for the preview
   site, on for everyone, its donation page, how it is written, removing it —
   then adding one and the default. The console's dialog shell, so it looks
   and closes like every other dialog. Each control saves as it changes. -#}
<div class="dlg-back c-set" id="cSet" hidden>
  <div class="dlg c-set-dlg" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="cSetTitle">
    <div class="c-set-head">
      <h3 id="cSetTitle" data-i18n="con.languages">Languages</h3>
      <button type="button" class="ln-x" id="cSetClose" aria-label="Close" data-i18n-attr="aria-label:con.close">&times;</button>
    </div>
    <div class="c-set-body" id="cSetBody"></div>
  </div>
</div>
